exports[`Desktop recovery and update presentation > 固定 { phase: 'CIRCUIT_OPEN', generation: 4, code: 'HOST_RESTART_BUDGET_EXHAUSTED', message: '自动恢复已暂停。' } 恢复层的语义和可见文案 1`] = `
